  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): WMD Cyber Crimes Investigations (CCI) Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CCI course was delivered to 20 Royal Malaysia Customs (RMC), Royal Malaysian Police, Cyber Security Defense, Ministry of Industry Technology and Infrastructure (MITI), and Malaysia Communication Broadcast Commission (MCBC). The CCI Course was specifically designed to educate investigators, analysts, prosecutors, and customs officials on the fundamental skills needed to exploit digital technology to combat criminal activities, the proliferation of WMD, and the misuse of dual-use materials and technology.</narrative>
  </description>
